  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa en Apoyo a la Agenda de Cambio Climtico de Mxico - Segunda Operacin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suppport Program for the Climate Change agenda in Mexico - Second Operation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Consolidar los instrumentos y medios necesarios para implementar la agenda de mitigacin y adaptacin al cambio climtico iniciada durante la Primera Operacin programtica. Esto incluye logros en el mbito institucional normativo, as como alcances en actividades especficas de mitigacin y adaptacin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To consolidate the instruments and the necessary means to implement the climate change mitigation and adaptation agenda, following the First Programmatic Operation (2047OC-ME). This includes achievements in the institutionalnormative frameworks, as well as specific activities in mitigation and adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
